# Project Rules - eKithab Audio Pipeline

## Architecture
- Decoupled monorepo: /client (Vite/React) and /server (Express/Node)
- Client deployed on Vercel, Server deployed on Render
- Supabase Free Tier for PostgreSQL + Storage
- Gnani.ai timbre-v2.5 for TTS

## API Contract (IMMUTABLE)
POST /api/audio/synthesize
Request: { chapterId, text, language, voiceProfile, speed }
Response: { success, audioUrl, durationSeconds, alignment: [{ sentenceIndex, text, startTime, endTime }] }

## Security Rules
- All API keys in /server/.env only
- Frontend never calls Gnani.ai or Supabase directly
- Rate limit: 5 requests/min per IP
- CORS restricted to Vercel frontend URL
- Atomic credit deduction: calculate → check balance → deduct → call Gnani

## Text Processing (Guardrails)
- Chunk at punctuation, max 400 chars per Gnani request
- Strip markdown: text.replace(/[#*`_\[\]]/g, '')
- Code-switching: rely on Gnani's phonetic processing for en-IN
- Alignment drift: normalize final endTime to actual buffer duration

## UI/UX
- Tailwind CSS + Shadcn/UI + Lucide React
- Active text: text-primary font-bold bg-primary/10 rounded-sm px-1
- Inactive text: text-muted-foreground
- Floating playback controls pill
- Keyboard accessible, 4.5:1 contrast minimum

